WEBVTT

00:00:30.344 --> 00:00:34.883
In my community, we never had
a culture of girls attending school

00:00:34.883 --> 00:00:37.433
beyond the age of 10 or 12 years.

00:00:38.763 --> 00:00:43.501
In fact, some women would tell me,
"Why do you need education?

00:00:43.501 --> 00:00:47.993
Just learn the household work
so that you can take care of your family."

00:00:49.433 --> 00:00:54.662
But I never wanted to abide myself
by the "normal" rules for girls.

00:00:55.592 --> 00:00:57.622
And I would think to myself,

00:00:57.622 --> 00:01:00.465
instead of just learning
the household work,